OL,3,GNEWSATributes as 'champion of the
OL,4,Atruth' test pilot dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily members, friends and campaigners
OL,7,Fhave paid tribute to a "fearless" and
OL,8,F"extraordinarily knowledgeable" former
OL,9,FRAF test pilot.
OL,11,FRetired Sqn Ldr Robert Burke, from
OL,12,FHampshire, helped to clear the pilots
OL,13,Fwho were wrongly blamed for the RAF
OL,14,FChinook ZD576 helicopter crash on the
OL,15,FMull of Kintyre in western Scotland on
OL,16,F2 June 1994, in which four crew and 25
OL,17,Fpassengers were killed.
OL,19,FThe Chinook Justice Campaign said Burke
OL,20,Fhad died on Monday at the age of 86,
OL,21,Ffollowing a short illness.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
