OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATributes as 'champion of the
OL,4,Atruth' test pilot dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Cook, brother of one of the
OL,7,Fpilots killed in the disaster, said
OL,8,FBurke had brought forward "clear
OL,9,Fevidence that proved, more than ever,
OL,10,Fhow unjust the accusations of gross
OL,11,Fnegligence were".
